        <li><strong>Create Offers:</strong> Add products to flash sale using the "Create Offer" button.</li>
        <li><strong>Campaigns:</strong> Group offers into themes (e.g., Diwali Sale) via the "Sale Campaigns" section.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Toggle:</strong> Enable/disable all flash sales across the store instantly.</li>
      </ul>`}
      guideHtmlHi={`<ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Create Offers:</strong> Naye products sale pe daalne ke liye "Create Offer" dabayein.</li>
        <li><strong>Campaigns:</strong> Offers ko group karne ke liye (jaise Diwali Sale) Campaigns section use karein.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Toggle:</strong> Store par poori flash sale chalu ya band karne ke liye upar wala toggle switch use karein.</li>
      </ul>`}
      quickActions={[
        { label: '➕ New Campaign', query: 'new campaign banao' },
        { label: '⚡ Add Offers', query: 'ek naya bulk offer create karo' },
        { label: '📊 Active campaigns', query: 'kitni active campaigns hain' },
        { label: '🔥 Flash sale enable', query: 'flash sale enable karo' }
      ]}
    />

    <!-- Stats Row -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm p-5 flex items-center gap-4">
